the eldest Miss of the Lu family,

63
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:39,120
Lu Qianqian.

64
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,800
Lu Qianqian.

65
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:45,640
Why are you here?

66
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:53,480
I really like this girl.

67
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,440
I wish you were my daughter-in-law.

68
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:58,320
I really like you.

69
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:12,960
Wen, let me introduce.

70
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:15,120
