71
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:18,040
She is an internationally renowned designer,

72
00:05:18,040 --> 00:05:20,320
Charles' most accomplished student, Jiang Li.

73
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,280
Hello.

74
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:33,600
Hello.

75
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,040
What do you want?

76
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,600
Li Yiwen,

77
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:48,360
is this your third

78
