87
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,120
How could you...

88
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,440
That's impossible.

89
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,240
Li Sisi's

90
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:15,480
mother died young.

91
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,680
She grew up with an alcoholic father.

92
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:19,720
She cut ties with her father as an adult.

93
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:22,320
She got into the School of Business Administration through her own efforts.

94
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,840
After graduation, she was full of hope.

95
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:25,160
But she faced workplace harassment.

96
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,800
She took her superior to court.

97
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:27,840
Although she won the lawsuit,

98
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:29,200
she suffered workplace bullying.

99
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:31,680
Then she changed her name to Li Xiaorou

100
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,080
[to start afresh.]

101
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:36,360
[She became Lu Qianqian's assistant.]

102
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:38,320
Zhou Jian was also arranged by you?

103
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:41,280
Your best friend Su Muchen asked you.

104
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,160
Who are you?

105
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:47,960
The sister who broke off contact with Su Muchen.

106
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:52,680
Su Muli.

107
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:56,480
My sister must have mentioned me to you.

108
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:00,640
Please let me go.

109
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:02,800
I didn't do anything.

110
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,080
I'm begging you,

111
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:05,080
please let me go.

112
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:08,280
I didn't set Zhou Jian up with Lu Qianqian,

113
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:10,520
and your sister's death has nothing to do with me.

114
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,720
The Lu family was like a mountain pressing down on me,

115
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:14,600
I had no choice but to pretend I knew nothing.

116
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,240
Indeed,

117
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,960
you didn't do anything before my sister died,

118
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:21,120
but as her best friend,

119
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:23,120
your cold indifference is just adding fuel to the fire.

120
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:25,640
You watched the Lu family drive her to death.

121
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:28,000
I'm sorry.

122
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,640
I had no choice.

123
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:33,640
What do I have to do to make you let me go?

124
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:37,000
Not everyone you say sorry to

125
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,760
will say it's okay.

126
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:41,240
You have to be punished for what you've done.

127
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:45,520
Give this USB drive to the media

128
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:47,440
the day before the release of Dark Fairy Tale.

129
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:50,640
Also do one thing at the press conference.

130
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:53,240
Use AI face swap to replace me in the live broadcast.

131
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:57,800
Where is Jiang Li?

132
00:07:58,200 --> 00:07:59,120
Where is she?

133
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:33,080
She's so beautiful.

134
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:05,720
Oh my god.

135
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,000
Impossible.

136
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,040
Impossible.

137
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:09,560
Impossible.

138
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:25,520
Jiang Li.

139
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,040
Hello, everyone.

140
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,720
I'm Lu Xu's fiancée,

141
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,800
the chief designer of Dark Fairy Tale.

142
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:37,920
You must be curious

143
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:39,720
why I don't have scars on my cheeks.

144
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,560
Because the avenger

145
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:43,040
whose hands were stained with blood

146
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:44,640
is a chapter I wrote

147
00:09:45,920 --> 00:09:47,240
for Dark Fairy Tale.

148
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:50,640
There's no prince offering a crystal shoe,

149
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:54,600
nor is there a wand that can erase scars.

150
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:57,880
We always expect a knight to slay a dragon,

151
00:09:58,320 --> 00:10:00,280
but we forget that in the oldest fairy tales,

152
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:03,000
it's always the princess who tears through the thorns.

153
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:05,280
Dark fairy tales are not excuses to sink,

154
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:08,240
but tell all those who have been scratched by life,

155
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:10,080
you don't need to wait for redemption,

156
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:13,840
because you are the fire that can burn the prairie.

157
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,280
Dark fairy tales are golden threads,

158
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:18,520
the first step towards luxury series clothing.

159
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:21,920
And this series is prepared for you.

160
00:10:42,800 --> 00:10:46,120
Okay.

161
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:04,560
Pleasure to cooperate.

162
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:57,640
How did you know I was in danger?

163
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,600
Because I couldn't get in touch with you,

164
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:03,160
my intuition told me you were in danger.

165
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,240
Jenny avoided the surveillance,

166
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:06,840
but the sentinel system of the electric car beside her

167
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:08,200
captured the whole process of your abduction.

168
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:09,880
How can you still smile?

169
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,400
You almost died just now,

170
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:12,200
do you know that?

171
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:15,240
If the Death God took me,

172
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:16,480
he would be afraid that hell would be expanded.

173
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:17,520
Dark Fairy Tale,

174
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:19,040
Is it really that important

175
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:19,840
in your revenge plan?

176
00:12:20,800 --> 00:12:22,280
Actually, no one knows

177
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:24,200
Annie wants the company to go public.

178
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:27,000
But she doesn't have enough capital.

179
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,120
She needs financing.

180
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:29,960
On the one hand, she wants to raise funds,

181
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,400
on the other hand, she refuses to increase her sister-in-law's capital.

182
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:33,880
Isn't it contradictory?

183
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:37,200
She's afraid that Zhuang Wan has too much equity,

184
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:39,040
which will deprive her of the actual control of the company.

185
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:41,480
So she needs to find your grandfather,

186
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:43,400
a financial group that absolutely does not allow cooperation, to raise funds.

187
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,280
Morgan.

188
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:46,240
Right.

189
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:47,400
For Annie,

190
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:49,200
there is no financial group more suitable than Morgan.

191
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,880
In this way, Zhuang Wan

192
00:12:51,880 --> 00:12:54,560
can be completely prevented from using the relationship of Shen Family.

193
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:58,720
And Dark Fairy Tale is her credential to Morgan.

194
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,240
How do you know all this?

195
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:05,480
Annie is so careful.

196
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:07,400
aren't you curious

197
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,800
why she would just let me

198
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,360
be Lu Xu's fiancée?

199
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,920
It is indeed a little strange.

200
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:19,080
Because there's a Valuation Adjustment Mechanism between Morgan and Annie.

201
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:22,600
If the first-day sales of Dark Fairy Tale reach 150 million,

202
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:26,000
Morgan will buy 20% of the shares in Annie's hands.

203
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,240
If not,

204
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,520
Morgan will convert the investment into a loan.

205
00:13:28,880 --> 00:13:30,520
To convert equity into a loan,

206
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:32,240
without damaging the brand image,

207
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:32,960
so

208
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:36,120
she invited my teacher Charles to design this series.

209
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:39,000
And I volunteered to take over this matter.

210
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,720
So Dark Fairy Tale is the first step,

211
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:42,080
and also the most critical step.

212
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:44,080
But if the sales of Dark Fairy Tale do not meet expectations,

213
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:47,120
isn't that just what Annie wants?

214
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,400
No one knows

215
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:51,600
that Morgan and I also have a VAM.

216
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:01,320
Am I not good enough to you?

217
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:03,280
Why do you help Jiang Li?

218
00:14:03,760 --> 00:14:05,800
You're using a small amount of money

219
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:07,760
to trample on my dignity as a human being.

220
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:09,120
Maybe

221
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:12,400
We define goodness differently.

222
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:15,640
I'm not doing this to help Jiang Li.

223
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:19,200
It's for the sake of the child in my belly.

224
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,440
You're pregnant?

225
00:14:21,760 --> 00:14:23,160
It's Lu Xu's child.

226
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:28,480
I once tried to take your place in his heart.

227
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:30,240
But then I realized

228
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:32,000
I was just a substitute

229
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,880
after he lost you.

230
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:36,200
When I let go of all this,

231
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:38,840
I realized it was a relief.

232
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:41,680
I will tell my child in the future

233
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:45,320
that his father is a lovesick bastard.

234
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:48,400
Because he has the right to know who his father is.

235
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:50,360
And your child

236
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:52,920
also has the right to know who his father is.

237
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,560
What do you mean?

238
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,720
You can tell Mumu

239
00:14:57,680 --> 00:14:58,640
that his father

240
00:14:58,640 --> 00:15:01,800
is a jerk who is infatuated with his mother.

241
00:15:36,920 --> 00:15:39,760
You guys came back so quietly.

242
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:41,880
Ms. Jiang,

243
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,360
madam is waiting for you inside.

244
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:13,880
Little Monster,

245
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:19,120
you're better at this than I thought.
